  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/mesophils_cities_classic.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Mesophil's Cities Classic 是 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mesophils-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mesophil's Cities</a> 的官方风格包。它包含在加载此数据包时会在城市维度生成的结构。</p>\n<h3>这是 Mesophil's Cities Classic 风格包的数据包版本。您可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mesophils-cities-classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>找到模组版本。</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/trailer.png\" alt=\"预告片：\"></p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"850\" height=\"468\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EkPz0Z5Yd-Q?si=ScF36IUQLibnZF6I\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/important.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果您在添加此数据包（及其依赖项）后，游戏在启动时崩溃且没有生成崩溃报告，请确保您安装的 Steam 'n' Rails 版本为最新版本 1.6.13 (alpha)。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/performance_note.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>目前，由于本模组中的结构包含大量来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Refurbished Furniture Mod</a> 的与电力相关的方块，这些方块需要较多的时间进行刻计算，因此该数据包在城市中运行时可能会对性能产生显著影响。我们将在未来尝试发布一个兼容性模组，以改善刻系统的性能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/used_mods.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish 的翻新家具模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Steam 'n' Rails</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-railways-navigator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Railways Navigator</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/headers/screenshots.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Quatryl23/Mesophils-Cities/main/images/screenshots/city_classic_view_7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
